because there'll be something to set me free. Maybe DNA, something like that. Investigators believed this suggested Brad knew the used condom would be found inside Tammy's body, most likely because he had planted it there in an attempt to frame Brian Clark. But if this was the case, how would he have obtained a condom with Brian's DNA on it? Investigators questioned Brian and learned that he would sometimes dispose of used condoms by throwing them out of his car window. Investigators began to suspect that Brad had tailed Tammy and Brian on more than one occasion. He had already admitted to having done so on the night of his wife's murder.
因为那样就会有东西能让我重获自由。也许是DNA之类的东西。”调查人员认为，这表明布拉德知道那个用过的避孕套会在塔米的体内被发现，最可能是因为那是他亲手藏进去的，企图嫁祸给布赖恩·克拉克。但如果真是这样，他是怎么弄到一个带有布赖恩DNA的避孕套的呢？调查人员盘问了布赖恩，得知他有时会通过把车窗摇下往外扔的方式来处理用过的避孕套。调查人员开始怀疑，布拉德不止一次地尾随过塔米和布赖恩。他其实已经在妻子遇害当晚承认过这一点。

